	<string>Speech recognition turns voice commands into actions, so the app can be used without touching the screen.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>The compass game uses the phone's heading to check which way you are facing. Your location is not stored or shared.</string>
